  {
    "id": "P0022",
    "report": "B",
    "text": "Actual: `set_waiter_value` consumes the guard and releases the computation lock before the resulting insert or removal completes. An async eviction listener can suspend that write, allowing subsequent computations to read the same previous value.\n\n"
