  {
    "id": "P0024",
    "report": "B",
    "text": "Evidence: `async_upserts_must_serialize_through_commit` performs three increments from zero while pausing the first replacement notification. The second and third computations both read `1`; the final value is **2 instead of 3**. This reproduced twice. The shared helper also serves the compute APIs.\n\n"
  },
  {
    "id": "P0025",
    "report": "B",
    "text": "retain the computation guard until the resulting cache operation completes, including error cleanup.\n\n"
