  {
    "id": "P0031",
    "report": "B",
    "text": "Evidence: probes insert a value with a 30 ms expiration, wait 50 ms, then replace it using an update callback that explicitly returns `None`. Both sync and async caches return **None instead of Some(2)**. A control that clears an unexpired deadline passes.\n\n"
  },
  {
    "id": "P0032",
    "report": "B",
    "text": "distinguish an elapsed deadline from an unset deadline\u2014for example, retain `Some(Duration::ZERO)` for elapsed time\u2014and ensure the callback can clear the stored expiration.\n\n"
