    "text": "- `cargo test --locked --features sync,future` \u2014 **passed**, including doctests.\n- `cargo fmt --all --check` \u2014 **passed**.\n- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings` \u2014 **passed**.\n- `RUSTDOCFLAGS=\"-D warnings\" cargo doc --workspace --no-deps --document-private-items --all-features` \u2014 **failed**, as described in finding 3.\n- `cargo test --workspace --all-features` \u2014 **229 passed, 7 ignored**.\n- `cargo check --locked --no-default-features --features sync` and the corresponding `future` command \u2014 **passed**.\n- `cargo check --locked --no-default-features` \u2014 rejected by the crate\u2019s explicit feature requirement; expected behavior.\n\n"
