    "id": "P0058",
    "report": "B",
    "text": "Outcome: **3 passed, 3 failed**. Failures cover finding 1 and both implementations of finding 2. Passing controls cover expiration clearing before expiry, loader/computation errors, optional initialization, borrowed-key access, and disabled predicate invalidation. Probe formatting, strict Clippy, and documentation checks passed. Evidence: `/work/tmp/probes.log`; quality-gate output: `/work/tmp/quality-check.log`.\n\n"
